# Progress Router Documentation

## File

`routes/progressRouter.js`

## Purpose

`progressRouter.js` logged-in user ki **module-level learning progress** ko manage karta hai.

Progress ko lesson level par nahi, **module level par** track kiya ja raha hai.

Example:

```text
User → Quantum Gates → 60% → In Progress
User → Qubits and Quantum States → 100% → Completed
```

---

## Authentication

Saare Progress endpoints protected hain.

`protect` middleware JWT token verify karta hai aur decoded token se:

```js
req.user.userId
```

available karata hai.

User ID request body se nahi li jaati.

