## Database Relationship

Progress collection mein:

```text
User
  │
  │ userId
  ▼
Progress
  │
  │ moduleId
  ▼
Module
```

Ek user aur ek module ka **sirf ek Progress document** hoga.

```text
User A + Module 1 → One Progress Document
User A + Module 2 → One Progress Document
User B + Module 1 → One Progress Document
```

Iske liye `userId + moduleId` par unique compound index use kiya gaya hai.

---

## Summary

| Method | Endpoint              | Purpose                       |
| ------ | --------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| PUT    | `/progress/:moduleId` | Module progress create/update |
| GET    | `/progress/:moduleId` | Specific module ki progress   |
| GET    | `/progress`           | User ki saari module progress |

**Progress module-level hai**, isliye current schema mein `lessonId` nahi rakha gaya hai.
